 *
 * Live evidence (dmtools-agents PR #1017 / gh-1000, 2026-10-18 08:04–08:09Z):
 * ONE rework cycle got TWO concurrent rework legs —
 *   run 39110030366 (08:04:12Z, PR-armed from rework-on-label) — its factory
