 * run's leg recovered from its run title (dispatch titles carry the leg;
 * event-path titles do not, so an unknown run leg only suppresses events
 * that also declare no leg — a different, KNOWN leg must never be
 * swallowed: the concurrency group already serializes genuinely distinct
 * legs).
